                    <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">{'{ success, data | error }'}</code> tanpa melempar exception, jadi
                    alurnya kita kontrol sendiri: map <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">issue</code> menjadi
                    <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">{'{ field, message }'}</code>, lalu lempar
                    <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">ValidationError</code>. Di controller, data valid dibaca dengan
