                <li><strong>JSON rusak</strong>: <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">express.json()</code> melempar <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">SyntaxError</code> bila body bukan JSON valid (mis. <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">{'{bad json'}</code>), kita balas <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">400</code> yang ramah.</li>
                <li><strong>Error aplikasi</strong>: <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">ValidationError</code>, <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">NotFoundError</code>, atau <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">AppError</code> lain memakai <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">statusCode</code> dan <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">message</code>-nya, plus <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">errors</code> bila membawa detail.</li>
